WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:07.224
Hopian: Welcome back, you three!

2
00:00:12.608 --> 00:00:14.109
Bello: Heroes!

3
00:00:14.129 --> 00:00:19.654
Danny: They made these special medals just for us.

4
00:00:19.674 --> 00:00:23.437
Tina: The normal medals are too heavy!

5
00:00:23.457 --> 00:00:30.002
Hopian: So did you have a busy day with the governor?

6
00:00:30.022 --> 00:00:32.024
Danny: Did we ever!

7
00:00:32.972 --> 00:00:36.794
Brad: The governor introduced us to the most famous giants in the land!

8
00:00:37.674 --> 00:00:40.415
Brad: I met Brainiac, the famous scientist!

9
00:00:40.475 --> 00:00:43.896
Tina: We got to see your best soccer team practice.

10
00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.097
Tina: Ginormous United is great!

11
00:00:47.378 --> 00:00:48.918
Hopian: I'm a big fan!

12
00:00:49.579 --> 00:00:50.859
Did you meet Dribbello?

13
00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.080
Tina: He autographed a shirt for me!

14
00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.041
Tina: You should have it.

15
00:00:56.641 --> 00:00:57.742
It's too big for me.

16
00:00:57.762 --> 00:01:00.443
Hopian: That's so exciting!

17
00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:01.643
Thank you.

18
00:01:04.576 --> 00:01:07.118
Danny: I have to say, I'm pretty tired though.

19
00:01:07.138 --> 00:01:08.119
Brad: Yes.

20
00:01:08.539 --> 00:01:10.301
It's hard work being a hero.

21
00:01:10.321 --> 00:01:13.043
Tina: And I miss my family.

22
00:01:13.063 --> 00:01:17.046
Hopian: I guess that means it's time for you to go.

23
00:01:17.066 --> 00:01:19.048
Bello: Wait.

24
00:01:19.668 --> 00:01:23.451
Brad: We haven't left yet, Bello.

25
00:01:23.491 --> 00:01:26.834
Hopian: I think he has something to show you.

26
00:01:26.854 --> 00:01:28.676
Bello: Picture.

27
00:01:28.696 --> 00:01:33.840
Hopian: Bello, that's a beautiful painting!

28
00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:35.161
Danny: Wow.

29
00:01:35.441 --> 00:01:37.122
You're really good at drawing, Bello.

30
00:01:37.162 --> 00:01:39.063
Tina: It's really nice!

31
00:01:40.204 --> 00:01:40.824
Brad: Hey, Danny.

32
00:01:41.125 --> 00:01:43.506
You're not the only one who likes art class!

33
00:01:44.067 --> 00:01:45.628
Bello: Tina.

34
00:01:47.229 --> 00:01:49.771
Tina: That's right, Bello!

35
00:01:49.791 --> 00:01:51.832
Bello: Brad.

36
00:01:51.852 --> 00:01:54.214
Brad: That's right, that's me!

37
00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:55.855
Bello: Danny.

38
00:01:55.875 --> 00:01:58.457
Danny: When did you learn our names?

39
00:01:59.297 --> 00:01:59.817
Bello: Bello.

40
00:02:00.338 --> 00:02:01.999
Danny. Tina.

41
00:02:02.699 --> 00:02:04.752
Brad. Friends.

42
00:02:07.634 --> 00:02:10.315
Danny: Hopian, Bello sure helped us a lot.

43
00:02:12.876 --> 00:02:14.696
Hopian: He's a very good boy.

44
00:02:15.417 --> 00:02:16.977
I'm very proud of him.

45
00:02:16.997 --> 00:02:18.038
Bello: Dada.

46
00:02:18.078 --> 00:02:23.140
Danny: I guess I guess we're done here.

47
00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:24.560
Tina: Yeah.

48
00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:26.241
We should go back to school.

49
00:02:26.261 --> 00:02:29.702
Hopian: I can't thank you enough, children.

50
00:02:29.722 --> 00:02:33.464
Danny: Well, you can do one last thing for us.

51
00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:34.880
Hopian: Anything.

52
00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:37.742
Danny: You can tell us how to get home.

53
00:02:37.762 --> 00:02:41.404
Hopian: Use your imagination, children.

54
00:02:41.964 --> 00:02:43.805
How do you think you can get home?

55
00:02:43.825 --> 00:02:45.586
Tina: The rainbow.

56
00:02:45.967 --> 00:02:47.467
The rainbow will get us home.

57
00:02:47.487 --> 00:02:50.109
Hopian: Why do you say that, Tina?

58
00:02:50.129 --> 00:02:54.331
Tina: The rainbow key was how we got to Ginormous.

59
00:02:54.811 --> 00:02:57.353
Tina: And a rainbow was the key to defeating Tristay.

60
00:02:57.373 --> 00:02:59.954
Hopian: That's right, Tina.

61
00:03:00.915 --> 00:03:02.796
The rainbow is the key.
